    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) of capturing decision artifacts at the moment of consensus. This foundational thesis was operationalized in July 2026, where the team reported [successful shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784282346970_1). Performance metrics from that period indicate a [peak in development velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784282346970_2), which the team attributes to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784282346970_3) acting as a critical technical unlock. The current discourse is framed by an inquiry into the [specific drivers of Sprint 4 delivery outcomes](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryDrivers), linking these recent technical milestones back to the original decision-capture mandate.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784282346970_1> ;
